			"Message": "docs(Worker): Rewrite README with benefit-focused messaging\n\nReplace feature-focused copy with outcome-oriented narrative. The README now opens with the core value proposition: offline-capable editor shell with encrypted auth tokens and auto-refresh.\n\nRemoved detailed technical sections (Key Features, System Architecture, Usage guide, Deep Dive, Code examples, Changelog) to reduce verbosity. Added ecosystem context and simplified license section.\n\nAlso updates TypeScript icon URL from cdn.simpleicons.org to editor.land CDN.",
